### Integration Tip:

If you want to include a short version inside your **JSON file**, you can add a "license" field at the top like this:

```json
{
  "project": "Marconi Mangano Quiz",
  "author": "Mirko Andò",
  "year": 2026,
  "license": "Copyright (c) 2026 Mirko Andò. Licensed for Educational Non-Commercial use only."
}

```
